    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716300/extras/24c23348144a38b365d9b64c1793beda.poster.avif?t=1727813862\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716300/extras/24c23348144a38b365d9b64c1793beda.webm?t=1727813862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716300/extras/24c23348144a38b365d9b64c1793beda.mp4?t=1727813862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Diminishing Light is a top-down action-driving game where you navigate the aftermath of a zombie apocalypse. Behind the wheel of a heavily armed vehicle, you fight to reconnect the remnants of civilization, battling through hordes of zombies and hostile marauders. This game combines intense driving action with strategic survival elements, inviting you to customize your ride, manage resources, and carve out safe zones in a world overrun by the undead.<br><br><strong>Gameplay Mechanics</strong><br><strong>Vehicular Combat:</strong> Engage in high-octane battles against zombies and human enemies alike. Your vehicle isn't just for travel; it's your primary weapon, equipped with an arsenal ranging from machine guns to flamethrowers.<br><br><strong>Customization: </strong>Tailor your vehicle to your playstyle. Upgrade armor, weaponry, and special abilities to tackle greater threats and venture into the most dangerous zones.<br><br><strong>Exploration and Survival:</strong> Navigate diverse landscapes, from deserted cities to treacherous wastelands. Scavenge for resources, rescue survivors, and establish supply routes to support your bases.<br><br><strong>Strategic Light Management:</strong> Utilize light as a resource to fend off the darkness and create safe havens. Power up defenses and ensure your community's survival against the night's terrors.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716300/extras/24c23348144a38b365d9b64c1793beda.poster.avif?t=1727813862\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716300/extras/24c23348144a38b365d9b64c1793beda.webm?t=1727813862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2716300/extras/24c23348144a38b365d9b64c1793beda.mp4?t=1727813862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Diminishing Light is a top-down action-driving game where you navigate the aftermath of a zombie apocalypse. Behind the wheel of a heavily armed vehicle, you fight to reconnect the remnants of civilization, battling through hordes of zombies and hostile marauders. This game combines intense driving action with strategic survival elements, inviting you to customize your ride, manage resources, and carve out safe zones in a world overrun by the undead.<br><br><strong>Gameplay Mechanics</strong><br><strong>Vehicular Combat:</strong> Engage in high-octane battles against zombies and human enemies alike. Your vehicle isn't just for travel; it's your primary weapon, equipped with an arsenal ranging from machine guns to flamethrowers.<br><br><strong>Customization: </strong>Tailor your vehicle to your playstyle. Upgrade armor, weaponry, and special abilities to tackle greater threats and venture into the most dangerous zones.<br><br><strong>Exploration and Survival:</strong> Navigate diverse landscapes, from deserted cities to treacherous wastelands. Scavenge for resources, rescue survivors, and establish supply routes to support your bases.<br><br><strong>Strategic Light Management:</strong> Utilize light as a resource to fend off the darkness and create safe havens. Power up defenses and ensure your community's survival against the night's terrors.",
